ulation of this application does not guarantee the design, size, range of motion, etc. of the actual robot.\nWhen actually installing a robot, please check the specifications on the product page.\n- Please be careful of your surroundings when using this app.", "short_description": "You can place OVR series virtual robots in real space and simulate operation.\nThe OVR series is a robot sold by Oriental Motor."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Icon.png", "id": "1594860848028062", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75210390_1594860854694728_1273340538204967659_n.png?_nc_cat=108&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=udc2qEQf2YcQ7kNvwGrcqYd&_nc_oc=AdojWYnPQTyiUcNKEgxsD4IeNdSBAL9CGh7Ji_BuT7akbFdurErzaTG2O8kcI2J4zeM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQVrz0s55w6k6Kv2gCVZMD_KXOdd9VJ5wCncWMK8BYVWlQ&oe=6B106616"}, {"file_name": "CoverArtLandscapeMini.png", "id": "858590429630683", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974810_858590432964016_3799015126354441121_n.png?_nc_cat=109&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=bD007aSB17oQ7kNvwFbKjYt&_nc_oc=AdpxrRpkM-2-uZbIQCI-x7pw4j2uSqOOJg4fQPbkCDVZH5yFsw-Nx-BERismH8yWWXU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQWeX8yi-1QojmZPGrTdJXhvhj4fDOCtVgmY9HKXcoTyyQ&oe=6B10699C"}, {"file_name": "CoverArtLandscape.png", "id": "495376463065176", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974810_495376466398509_7417159219708782199_n.png?_nc_cat=103&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=5Z9meEq4YpoQ7kNvwGeAfdr&_nc_oc=AdoSYTBKHV-iZXu8qKULT6uHVrlxLbX7twrbPtVVxISBqvwf7aNbhCYP49TkaGMq6bA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQV6xJ7xe6ZFS9E6om7FT4xgh5eRfPbcGRDlHUyq12VqJg&oe=6B104ADB"}, {"file_name": "CoverArtPortrait.png", "id": "486